  "body": "Hello folks\r\n\r\nAs a Deaf programmer I just found a missing documentation on the <source> HTML tag while working on my project www.videomail.io\r\n\r\nHave it reported here https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=758757\r\n\r\nBut I think it might be a problem within https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-source-element\r\n\r\nNowhere it's mentioned how the video file will be named when the native download button within the native video player is clicked. It is always named as `download`.",
